+beta=L_f(alpha) for a normal alpha and complementary factors f*g=x^(2k)-1.
+For odd t and A=2^s, put y=x^A,
+  f=(y+1)(1+y+...+y^(t-1)),
+  g=(y-1)(y^(t-1)-y^(t-2)+...-y+1).
