codex
Rejected honestly: no shippable generator was produced.

The native Track-B candidate passed every local G/V gate, but failed H: the oracle pool solved all 12/12 bare attempts, including the final within-cap escalation. The prior primitive-element proposal also fails G because the paper’s Appendix algorithm searches over translates.

Key measurements:

- Generic gcd reference: 105,980,792 coefficient operations across eight instances.
- Compact route: 218 operations.
- Structure-aware guesses: 0/200,000.
- Oracle hardening: 12/12 solved; verdict `too_easy`.

Artifacts:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.26972/REJECTED.md)
- [Retained generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.26972/rejected_gen_2510.26972.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.26972/selftest_report.json)
- [Oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.26972/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Harness metadata](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2510.26972/.meta.json)

Per STEP 4, G9 arms and a shipping README were not produced after the `too_easy` verdict.
